<!--
  MasterClock — es

  Mode names (Fischer, Byoyomi, Sudden Death…) and chess variant names are Kotlin literals rather
  than resources, so they stay in English by construction — see the notes in values/strings.xml.

  app_name and settings_app_version are left out on purpose: they are the product name.

  Translated without a native reviewer, unlike the French files. Wording is the part to check first
  if a Spanish speaker reads this; placeholders and plural categories were verified mechanically.
-->
